   "text": "### Ingredients\n\n- 200 g spaghetti\n- 1 can of crushed tomatoes\n- 2 cloves of garlic and a pinch of salt\n\n### Steps\n\n1. Boil salted water and cook the spaghetti for 9 minutes.\n2. Fry the garlic in olive oil, add the tomatoes and simmer for 10 minutes.\n3. Mix the pasta into the sauce and serve hot.\n\n```bash\n# this line is code, not a heading\necho \"timer 9m\"\n```\n\n",
